amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/bfeba404e89094b0520532993c94c1ce6b85f06b/ss_bfeba404e89094b0520532993c94c1ce6b85f06b.600x338.jpg?t=1745498576"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/2c48179d0e02807e16d82214786bc1771e35c632/ss_2c48179d0e02807e16d82214786bc1771e35c632.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745498576","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/2c48179d0e02807e16d82214786bc1771e35c632/ss_2c48179d0e02807e16d82214786bc1771e35c632.600x338.jpg?t=1745498576"}],"short_description":"Immortum is Psychological Sci-Fi horror with limited lives. Survive a hostile decaying spaceship, escape mind bending traps, and uncover the impossible truth as Romi, a mother desperate to find her dying child. Can you find the answers before your existence is erased?","steam_appid":3484010,"support_info":{"email":"quantomuse@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}